    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The arrival of the Eastern Oklahoma Railway in 1904 helped Quay become a major agricultural and oil center.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4,
        21
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://unitedstatesghosttowns.com/quay-oklahoma-ghost-town/"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Quay flourished during the oil boom era between 1914 and 1919.",
